  "content": "<h1><em><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bWMYAqyGe9g&list=PLp0jZgheSlXv_vjilwnbrOtdbmgvz1VkC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bWMYAqyGe9g?list=PLp0jZgheSlXv_vjilwnbrOtdbmgvz1VkC\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></a></em></h1>\n<h1>請閱讀！</h1>\n<p><em>請閱讀以下內容，並在下載前備份您的世界！</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>[僅限 Fabric] 必須安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric API</strong></a>。請安裝與對應 Minecraft 版本匹配的最新版 Fabric API。</li>\n<li>[僅限 Fabric] <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mod Menu</strong></a> 為選配項目，但可讓您輕鬆設定模組選項。</li>\n<li>請<strong>檢查所有擴充套件</strong>，確保它們與最新版的 Minecraft Transit Railway 相容！版本不匹配的擴充套件將無法運作。</li>\n<li>歡迎前往 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mtrbbs.top%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MTRBBS</a> 論壇提出問題、建議或回報 Bug！</li>\n<li>本模組<strong>不會</strong>再更新支援任何舊版 Minecraft。原始碼已在 GitHub 公開，您可以自行修改。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Minecraft Transit Railway 4.0.0</h2>\n<p><em>Minecraft Transit Railway</em> 是一款 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fMods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 模組</a>，允許您使用自動化的列車、船隻、纜車和飛機來建造自己的交通網絡！</p>\n<p>4.0.0 版本是全新重寫的版本。車輛模擬程式碼已從 Minecraft 執行個體中分離，大幅降低了 Minecraft 伺服器的延遲。</p>\n<h2>4.0.0 主要功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>自訂列車配置</li>\n<li>逼真的轉向架與列車移動效果</li>\n<li>改進的信號系統</li>\n<li>橫向電梯</li>\n<li>移植自 Nemo's Transit Expansion 的 OBJ 功能</li>\n<li>車輛晃動效果</li>\n<li>全新的線上系統地圖與 OneBusAway 整合</li>\n<li>客戶端 FPS 提升與伺服器端 TPS 提升</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLp0jZgheSlXuQCXu9UynrKuBnq2Ef_TSI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">詳細查看這些功能。</a></p>\n<h2>推薦擴充套件</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fthe-tube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>MTR 倫敦地鐵擴充套件</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjcm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Joban Client Mod</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fstation-decoration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>車站裝飾</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frussian-metro-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>俄羅斯地鐵擴充套件</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>協助翻譯此模組！</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrwd.in%252fminecraft-transit-railway\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Transit Railway 模組的 Crowdin 翻譯網站</a>已上線！</p>\n<p>Crowdin 是一個基於雲端的平台，讓翻譯者能為專案做出貢獻。在您的幫助下，我們能將此模組翻譯成多種語言。您可以建立免費帳戶開始進行翻譯。</p>\n<h2>有問題？意見？投訴？</h2>\n<p>讓我們聯繫起來。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/PVZ2nfUaTW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jonafanho/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/master/images/footer/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.linkedin.com%252fin%252fjonathanho33\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jonafanho/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/master/images/footer/linked_in.png\" alt=\"LinkedIn\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"mailto:jonho.minecraft@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jonafanho/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/master/images/footer/email.png\" alt=\"Email\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/minecraft_transit_railway\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jonafanho/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/master/images/footer/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/PVZ2nfUaTW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jonafanho/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/master/images/footer/join-us-on-discord.png\" alt=\"Join us on Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/minecraft_transit_railway\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jonafanho/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/master/images/footer/become-a-patron-on-patreon.png\" alt=\"Become a Patron on Patreon\"></a> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49fd23a75fd384b28d486c1471a72b7d4677c821.jpeg\" alt=\"Image 1\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d2718\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e2f99c38fc8db3ae5fd89f534aae45129cf6987b.jpeg\" alt=\"Image 2\"></a></p>",
